BASE-FACEBOOK-WAV2VEC2-BASE-960H-RIDGE","component":"wav2vec-2-0-base-facebook-wav2vec2-base-960h-ridge","contract_sha256":"f4429f3afde1096d29068f51ddace56c591a290d793097a671a125f4ff7a9a68","decision":"DEFER","disposition":"Caller-supplied FP32 wav2vec2-base-960h encoder plus ridge rate-head readiness blocker; no implementation, adapter, asset or result.","exact_blockers":[{"artifact_id":"ART-02","id":"BLK-01","linked_gates":["RG-01","RG-02"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply the immutable upstream snapshot at revision 22aad52d435eb6dbaf354bdad9b0da84ce7d6156 with every file's byte count and SHA-256, the reviewed model card and license/notice bundle, and a redistribution/product-use decision.","statement":"The exact facebook/wav2vec2-base-960h weight snapshot is absent. The research source record pins model.safetensors at 377,607,901 bytes and SHA-256 8aa76ab2..., but no local file exists at the model checkpoint directory, data/checkouts, data/models or the Hugging Face cache. The smallest verifiable encoder reference cannot be built from metadata alone, and no weight was downloaded or reconstructed.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-03","id":"BLK-02","linked_gates":["RG-03"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply a locked offline environment with exact Python/torch/transformers/scikit-learn/numpy versions, wheel hashes, install/import digest, deterministic settings and one intra-op/one inter-op thread, then record a clean-room import and load.","statement":"No pinned runtime is present. Python 3.10.13 with torch 2.2.2, transformers 4.40.2, scikit-learn and numpy is required, but the available 3.11.5 interpreter exposes no torch, transformers or scikit-learn build for this task, and the historical data/envs/sylnet-py310 environment is absent. No import, load or inference was attempted.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-04","id":"BLK-03","linked_gates":["RG-02","RG-03","RG-05"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Supply a serialized per-fold head artifact with SHA-256/byte count, or a reproducible head-training record that pins fold boundaries, feature dims, scaler statistics, alpha, library versions and the resulting artifact digest.","statement":"No ridge-head artifact is present. The historical pilot fitted a StandardScaler plus Ridge(alpha=10) head inside each of five chronological folds and saved only predictions in the results JSON; no joblib/npz head, scaler parameters, fold index or feature inventory was serialized. The FP32 embedding NPZ is a derived feature archive, not a head.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-05","id":"BLK-04","linked_gates":["RG-04","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Freeze a permitted, speaker/meeting-disjoint rate cohort with reviewed AMI/corpus and CMUdict terms, independently checked syllable labels, language/speaker groups and source-timestamp provenance.","statement":"The historical cohort is one AMI EN2003a meeting (210 four-second windows), not a rights-cleared multi-meeting rate corpus. Reference syllables come from AMI orthographic transcripts plus CMUdict 1.1.1 first pronunciations, not human syllable-nucleus labels. AMI audio/annotation and CMUdict terms have not been reviewed here, and no audio byte was read for this package.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-06","id":"BLK-05","linked_gates":["RG-05","RG-06"],"qualifies":false,"required_action":"Run the FP32 encoder plus fitted ridge head on the qualified cohort with a frozen scorer, exact folds, finite-output checks, constant-fold-mean and zero-rate baselines, and adverse/missing controls.","statement":"No FP32 accuracy, nonnegative-rate, finite-output or baseline comparison was reproduced. The pilot's recorded MAE/RMSE/r, negative prediction count and timing are quoted context only; the archived FP32 embeddings are not loaded, scored or promoted, and no adverse, missing, invalid or nonfinite control was exercised against a real encoder.","status":"open"},{"artifact_id":"ART-07","id":"BLK-06"